"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids shows January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025, September to October came in at 40% of normal and October to November at 45% on the county&rsquo;s middle value. June to July is the wettest pair at 6.76 inches normal, and January to February is the driest at 2.58.</p>"}
